<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets warrants on basket of HK hotel stocks.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on basket of HK hotel stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>SocGen-Crosby Securities said on Monday it has issued 105 million American-style call warrants on a basket of four hotel stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p>Hong Kong and Shanghai Hotels Ltd	 0.70 share</p>
<p>Regal Hotels International Holdings Ltd 2.90 shares</p>
<p>Shangri-La Asia Ltd			   0.60 share</p>
<p>Sino Hotels (Holdings) Ltd		  1.00 share</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$26.31	  PREMIUM    12.31 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$0.48	   GEARING    5.77X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     10.FEB.98	 PAYDATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	  LUXEMBOURG	BOARD LOT  10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
